Neo4j PoC: Customer 360 & Relationship Discovery
Objective
Build a Customer 360 view that combines customer, account, card, address, phone, and transaction data to answer questions such as:
Who are all related customers?
Which customers share contact information?
Which customers belong to the same household?
Are there suspicious relationships indicating potential fraud?
What is the complete relationship network around a customer?
