Expected PoC Deliverables
Load 500–1000 records.
Create graph model.
Build 5–10 Cypher queries.
Demonstrate Neo4j visualization.
Compare a complex SQL join query vs Neo4j traversal query.
Show a Customer 360 dashboard screenshot from Neo4j Browser.
This PoC is typically achievable in 2–3 days and demonstrates graph traversal, relationship discovery, Customer 360, and fraud analytics in one compact example.
